{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"creative-overcooked-perch","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nChild 3 of 3 under epic acute-agitable-xiphosuran (003c-2dd2-203a-4725), per the operator\ndecomposition decision of 2026-08-19. Sequenced LAST — not because of defect count, but because it\nCOLLIDES with the reconciler port-boundary work already scoped by cc77-8120-bcc6-47e8. Landing this\nfirst would force annotations onto seams that work is actively reshaping, producing merge churn and\nannotations that describe a boundary about to change.\n\n## Scope\nPromote `rebar._engine.*` into tier 1 (`disallow_untyped_defs`) in pyproject.toml and pin it in\n`_RATCHET_BASELINE`. Residue measured on main @ ea6ee67e6a: 134 untyped defs, ~224 explicit Any —\nthe largest explicit-Any concentration of the three packages.\n\n## Sequencing constraint\nDo NOT claim this until the reconciler port-boundary work on cc77-8120-bcc6-47e8 has landed, or\nuntil its owner confirms the affected seams are stable. Re-measure the residue at claim time; the\ncounts above will have moved.\n\n## Constraints (inherited from the epic)\n- No `cast()`, no `: Any` / `-> Any` to satisfy the ratchet.\n- Tier 2 is a separate later step.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `mypy src/rebar/_engine --disallow-untyped-defs` is clean with NO new `: Any` / `-> Any`.\n- [ ] `rebar._engine.*` is in the tier-1 override and pinned in `_RATCHET_BASELINE`.\n- [ ] No file exceeds the 800 LOC cap; complexity ratchet shows no new/increased entries.\n- [ ] Behaviour unchanged: existing engine/reconciler tests pass unmodified.","id":"5f7f-528f-031e-4919","parent_id":"003c-2dd2-203a-4725","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Promote rebar._engine.* into the mypy tier-1 typing ratchet (134 untyped defs, ~224 explicit Any)"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787174148041322001,"uuid":"56ad1bd6-33ee-4276-b2eb-549b772302ad"}